            "collapsible-title": "<strong>Is this USB-C charger good for travel?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>Yes. With its compact size and foldable plug, this portable wall charger easily fits into your bag or luggage, making it ideal for travel, commuting, and everyday use.</p>",
