        "tab_content_fjWWzA": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>How fast is the 35W USB-C fast charger?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>With 35W PD3.0 fast charging, this charger can power iPhone 15 Pro Max up to about 60% in 30 minutes and fully charge iPad Pro 11\" in around 2.5 hours, delivering fast and efficient charging.</p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        },
        "tab_content_Wrb3qd": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>What devices are compatible with this Apple charging block?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>This multi-port USB-C charger is compatible with iPhone 15/14/13/12/11/XR/X/8/7/6, Apple Watch Series 9/Ultra 2/8/Ultra/7/6/5/4/3/SE, as well as iPad and MacBook Air. It’s designed as an all-in-one charging solution for Apple users.</p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        },
        "tab_content_KQRxtY": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>Does this charger include a built-in Apple Watch charger?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>Yes. The charger includes a built-in foldable Apple Watch charger, which can fully charge Apple Watch Series 9 in about 1.3 hours without needing an additional watch charging cable.</p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        },
        "tab_content_NVT3iN": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>Is it safe to use this fast charger for Apple devices?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>Yes. The charger includes a smart protection chip that prevents overheating, short circuits, overcharging, over-voltage, and over-current, ensuring safe and stable charging.</p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        }
